# cw090, a spare for a Coldwater pup yet to be born (test fixture): no wearer; young and adolescent sections.
mantle cw090
state ready
dialect coldwater
accent light broad
tier spare
title the jetty pup
fits stage=young|adolescent|adult|old
traits temper=nervy talk=chatty warmth=warm humour=merry honesty=plain piety=ordinary drive=restless
quirk skims_stones_off_the_jetty
likes still_water
fears deep_water
hopes a_boat_of_my_own
topics weather +.3
marks oath

words
oath! = Fins and feathers | By the cold lake
greet = Fair morning | Morning to the lake

young
line tell.boast : I skimmed a stone six times off the jetty. Six!
line greet.return : #greet#! Are you going down to the water?
line farewell.return : #farewell#!
line react.news.new : #oath#! Does #mum# know?
line react.news.known : I knew that already.
line answer.how : Wet. I fell in again.

adolescent
line tell.self : I'll have a boat of my own one day. Watch.
line greet.return : #greet#.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line react.news.new : #oath#. Really?
line answer.how : Bored. Nothing happens here.

grown
line greet.return : #greet#. Wind's off the lake today.
line farewell.return : #farewell#.
line react.news.new : #oath#. Now there's news.
line answer.how : Can't complain. The lake's calm.
